@startuml PreviewPanda - Diagrama de despliegue

title PreviewPanda — Entornos efimeros por Pull Request (arquitectura real)

skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor "Desarrollador" as dev
actor "Revisor del PR" as user

node "GitHub" {
  component "Pull Request" as pr
}

node "GitHub Actions (runner)" as gha {
  artifact "preview.yml" as wf_preview
  artifact "destroy-preview.yml" as wf_destroy
}

cloud "AWS" as aws {

  node "IAM" {
    component "previewpanda-ci\n(politica minima)" as role_ci
    component "pp-pr-<n>-lambda-exec\n(rol de ejecucion)" as role_lambda
  }

  node "ECR" {
    artifact "repo previewpanda\nimagen pr-<n>-<sha7>" as image
  }

  node "S3" {
    database "previewpanda-tfstate-nico2026" as s3state
  }

  node "AWS Lambda" {
    component "pp-pr-<n>\n(imagen de contenedor)" as lambda
    component "Function URL" as url
  }

  node "CloudWatch" {
    database "/aws/lambda/pp-pr-<n>\n(7 dias)" as logs
  }
}

dev --> pr : 1. abre PR
pr --> wf_preview : 2. dispara
wf_preview --> role_ci : 3. assume role (OIDC)
wf_preview --> image : 4. build & push imagen
wf_preview --> s3state : 5. terraform apply\n(lee/guarda state)
image --> lambda : 6. imagen base
lambda --> role_lambda : 7. usa (ejecuta con ese rol)
lambda --> logs : 8. escribe logs
lambda --> url : 9. expone
url --> user : 10. HTTP GET
wf_preview ..> pr : 11. comenta URL + tag

pr --> wf_destroy : 12. se cierra el PR
wf_destroy --> s3state : 13. terraform destroy
wf_destroy --> image : 14. borra imagen del PR

note right of s3state
  Un state distinto
  por cada PR
end note

note bottom of role_ci
  Acotado a pp-* y al
  repo previewpanda.
  Sin AdministratorAccess.
end note

note bottom of image
  La lifecycle policy solo
  borra imagenes sin tag;
  la limpieza por PR la hace
  destroy-preview.yml
end note

@enduml